WEBVTT
Language: en

NOTE
Voiced by Tello (Kokoro af_heart). V4 narration — free-home story, Nov 2026.

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.200
I'm Tello.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.190
Your first home is free — no clock, no card — and it stays free.

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:14.690
Title22 packages: $29/mo for one home, $79 for two to five, $139 for six or more.

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.760
And staff training is included in every package.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:24.660
Courses by Community Training Connection (CTC) — included in every package

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:31.190
On an earlier plan? Add training by beds — 1–6 beds, $20/mo

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:34.780
7–15 beds — $35/mo · 16–49 beds — $60/mo · 50+ beds — $100/mo

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.090
Finished courses land in the staff file

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:46.540
Tello Staff — schedule board · Today's Board · staff directory

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:48.910
FREE during your 30-day proof

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:53.090
Then $10/mo per home — only if you choose it

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:55.430
Here is the promise.

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:56.860
No hidden fees.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.350
Nothing is charged unless you choose it.

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:05.050
Cancel either add-on — your plan stays
